    <description><![CDATA[## What is Debug Skill?

Debug Skill.

## Usage

The package installs the `dap` command. Open a new terminal after installing so the PATH change takes effect, then see the [Debug Skill documentation](https://github.com/AlmogBaku/debug-skill) for the available options.
]]></description>
